","t":"熟者也癸二明性種性第一性"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0329a01","n":"0329a","t":"種性道者初地上所得之無漏"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0330a01","n":"0330a","t":"此下第二明信忍此信忍初二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0331a01","n":"0331a","t":"疑惑是也斷諸纏蓋者煩惱無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0332a01","n":"0332a","t":"即順而忍名曰順忍前三地菩"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0333a01","n":"0333a","t":"初遠行地即是下無生忍此地"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0334a01","n":"0334a","t":"故雖有勝佛果劣菩薩之分而"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0335a01","n":"0335a","t":"一相可得故曰平等無二一切"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0336a01","n":"0336a","t":"其義詳前無緣大悲四句明應"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0337a01","n":"0337a","t":"者以其三界無明未斷盡故自"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0338a01","n":"0338a","t":"此下第二答云何化眾生問佛"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0339a01","n":"0339a","t":"下此地菩薩應生於南贍部州"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0340a01","n":"0340a","t":"四面各有八天中有一天曰帝"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0341a01","n":"0341a","t":"此下第四明四地菩薩應如是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0342a01","n":"0342a","t":"樂之眾所變化也十二因緣如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0344a01","n":"0344a","t":"界主以見不可說不可說佛國"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0345a01","n":"0345a","t":"此即顯法會大眾供養如來如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0346a01","n":"0346a","t":"皆能修出三界之妙行習菩薩"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0347a01","n":"0347a","t":"具此十善心謂之發大心菩薩"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0349a01","n":"0349a","t":"夜摩王等四句表三地為上信"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0355a01","n":"0355a","t":"言無義也心智一句顯智德也"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0359a01","n":"0359a","t":"法性身以法性身常周法界普"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0360a01","n":"0360a","t":"顛倒即有六趣四生之相若順"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0361a01","n":"0361a","t":"是故一切菩薩摩訶薩等十句"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0362a01","n":"0362a","t":"之佛如海中之一漚是故前云"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0363a01","n":"0363a","t":"此正明益也此中初三忍明伏"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0364a01","n":"0364a","t":"己三答以何相而住觀察庚一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0366a01","n":"0366a","t":"之不捨若經一現行即有一度"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0367a01","n":"0367a","t":"切有礙有變之物非只現前眼"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0368a01","n":"0368a","t":"由領受外境後遂起如是想者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0370a01","n":"0370a","t":"諸法緣生剎那不住相續不斷"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0371a01","n":"0371a","t":"定如第二月第二月者捏目所"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0373a01","n":"0373a","t":"相而觀察也庚二法利說是法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0374a01","n":"0374a","t":"幻有無體謂之世俗諦勝義世"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0375a01","n":"0375a","t":"世俗諦者但是假施設耳然今"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0376a01","n":"0376a","t":"當為汝說一二之義也己三正"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0377a01","n":"0377a","t":"作者生起之義勝義諦體本來"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0378a01","n":"0378a","t":"解若有若無不即不離如牛首"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0379a01","n":"0379a","t":"為幻如演幻術之幻師不但不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0381a01","n":"0381a","t":"覺法皆無自他之相無明即指"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0382a01","n":"0382a","t":"著文字則違於實今欲不離俗"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0383a01","n":"0383a","t":"來之事者是也四諷誦凡孤起"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0384a01","n":"0384a","t":"為根本智母者此智即是初證"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0386a01","n":"0386a","t":"無量也若菩薩隨諸有情見一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0387a01","n":"0387a","t":"二也丁二法利戊一就能說明"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0388a01","n":"0388a","t":"此就所說之般若波羅密多以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0390a01","n":"0390a","t":"不思議功德上來諸品已敘其"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0392a01","n":"0392a","t":"急廣集法師率眾講習行持此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0394a01","n":"0394a","t":"滿足一切所求者如欲假官位"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0395a01","n":"0395a","t":"能也提桓天也因帝也釋提桓"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0398a01","n":"0398a","t":"大災劫之一大千即三千大千"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0399a01","n":"0399a","t":"諸有皆空也有為者生滅法也"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0400a01","n":"0400a","t":"為道得無生忍一節顯般若之"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0401a01","n":"0401a","t":"護國之法已為汝等宣說願汝"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0402a01","n":"0402a","t":"知所知此等作用微妙祕奧非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0404a01","n":"0404a","t":"云白蓮花八萬四千者謂具八"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0405a01","n":"0405a","t":"義也此上所表各地位之行果"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0406a01","n":"0406a","t":"利益無量汝等大眾及未來眾"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0407a01","n":"0407a","t":"如是一佛身入無量眾生身二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0408a01","n":"0408a","t":"奉者信受之義持者行持之義"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0409a01","n":"0409a","t":"明遍照如來意謂此佛即以遍"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0412a01","n":"0412a","t":"句明第七不退住三業無失二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0414a01","n":"0414a","t":"屈撓即第四修精進波羅密多"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0415a01","n":"0415a","t":"真實觀中也中品修八萬四千"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0416a01","n":"0416a","t":"此三賢位中道種性菩薩修十"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0417a01","n":"0417a","t":"菩提皆得普修此即第九無縛"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0418a01","n":"0418a","t":"如上已釋得善調伏等四句明"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0420a01","n":"0420a","t":"此諸障品皆無明故滅三界貪"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0421a01","n":"0421a","t":"句明隨所願生佛土也此地菩"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0422a01","n":"0422a","t":"百萬行願者明在此地中修百"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0423a01","n":"0423a","t":"身心寂滅最勝寂滅者所證真"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0426a01","n":"0426a","t":"功德具足圓滿其本願非如小"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0427a01","n":"0427a","t":"智也次二句明所證真如無差"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0428a01","n":"0428a","t":"專以定力進發諸行故云常修"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0429a01","n":"0429a","t":"覆等六句明十二緣生之流轉"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0431a01","n":"0431a","t":"便均不出定而能莊嚴者也壬"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0432a01","n":"0432a","t":"佛加持至普皆利樂一節顯此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0434a01","n":"0434a","t":"冰釋普生歡喜也於萬阿僧祇"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0435a01","n":"0435a","t":"下化之業用至此已得圓滿自"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0436a01","n":"0436a","t":"舍異熟識而轉得之白淨識亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0437a01","n":"0437a","t":"真如故云無相初地以上具妙"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0438a01","n":"0438a","t":"十方世界現全身是也庚三總"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0442a01","n":"0442a","t":"日月薄蝕者明無光也日無光"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0443a01","n":"0443a","t":"庚二答辛一明禍因諸惡積此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0445a01","n":"0445a","t":"事帝釋也辛三結明禍福因此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0447a01","n":"0447a","t":"之變相北方等五句明北方菩"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0448a01","n":"0448a","t":"一敘咒因此敘說咒之因也咒"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0450a01","n":"0450a","t":"怛嚩此云大勇摩賀迦嚕抳此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0451a01","n":"0451a","t":"此云大普賢步彌此云地涅哩"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0456a01","n":"0456a","t":"家令三寶得以住持並制出家"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0458a01","n":"0458a","t":"此下第四明隨因感果誡大王"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0460a01","n":"0460a","t":"無盡苦非佛法之咎乃自致之"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/TX06n0005_p0462a01","n":"0462a","t":"他得大安樂盡未來際法舫記"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-太虛-第五編-仁王護國般若波羅密多經講錄","source":"CBETA TX06n0005 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":580,"unit":"TX6 頁欄"}